    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.8</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 00:00:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Opt1 1.0.8 release notes&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
           font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
    h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 1em; }
    code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
           background: rgba(127,127,127,0.15); padding: 1px 4px;
           border-radius: 3px; }
    pre code { display: block; padding: 8px; }
    ul, ol { padding-left: 1.5em; }
    a { color: #0a84ff; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Opt1 1.0.8&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's new&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overhauled the UI for simple clues so you now have the most important information front and centre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added emote guidance and equipment information for emote clues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added hidey hole information for emote clues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can now mark a hidey hole as filled so you don't have to remember yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cryptic clues are instruction-first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge scroll answers now appear in the UI for the clue instead of having to press Opt+1 again to get the challenge scroll answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The UI now warns you if you should beware of double agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate clues now show dig info before reiterating the coordinates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closest teleport now shows the two closest teleports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligned colours of clue difficulty badges to in-game colours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added close buttons to all interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added intial support for the Wendlewick elite scan clue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added Havenhythe teleport information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added all new natures sentinel outfit teleports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added missing anagram clue for Cook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added some missing teleport information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</description>
