      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 23:09:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Opt1 1.0.5 release notes&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
           font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
    h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 1em; }
    code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
           background: rgba(127,127,127,0.15); padding: 1px 4px;
           border-radius: 3px; }
    pre code { display: block; padding: 8px; }
    ul, ol { padding-left: 1.5em; }
    a { color: #0a84ff; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Opt1 1.0.5&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's new&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the ability to add custom keybind instructions for all teleports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the ability to mark a teleport item as not owned so it will not be suggested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug mode is now on by default. You can opt out in settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compass intersection now snaps to known dig spot if there is only one within range.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved scan guidance by adding pathing information to the scan optimiser (experimental).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scan guidance UI (experimental) now shows teleport information if next spot is a teleport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opt1 is now open-source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compass beams are no longer hidden when the map is zoomed in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed erroneous matches of 'treasure' in chat log text as clue scroll title&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed wilderness crater scan matching against deep wilderness scan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added some missing teleports to dorgesh-kaan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added validation of OCR'd scan range for scan clues to prevent inaccurate scan guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</description>
